## The Final Comprehensive Web Matrix
To view the entirety of the web-only landscape without user interaction, every flaw targets a handoff of trust between web components:

* HTTP Layer: Exploded via Request Smuggling (exploiting parsing differences between proxies and backends).
* Caching Layer: Subverted via Cache Poisoning/Deception (tricking edge nodes into storing or exposing private data strings).
* Application Framework Layer: Pierced via SSTI or Mass Assignment (forcing template engines or object mappers to execute input as code/attributes).
* Asynchronous Layer: Exploited via Job Queue Desynchronization (breaking time-of-check to time-of-use validations across workers).
* Data Layer: Manipulated via Second-Order SQLi or LFI Log Poisoning (storing payloads safely that execute destructively when read later).

Defensive engineering mitigates this entire baseline by ensuring that data formatting is strict, systems use centralized atomic states rather than asynchronous assumptions for financial checks, and input processing engines are completely sandboxed from execution runtimes.
